          "id": 1244554426,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I have a script to search for occurrences of a given display filter, and was going to use dftest to check that the filter was valid (could use tshark, although it'd need to also load a file).\n\nHaving said that, even if I did add it to tools (I still want to make it work with profiles, add individual preferences with -o, check multiple files in parallel), I doubt it is something we'd want to install.",
