      ],
      "title": "Remove dftest man page",
      "message": "Remove dftest man page\n\nDFTest is a private test utility and isn't installed anywhere.\n\nI don't think it makes sense to maintain a man page. Certainly\ndoesn't make sense to ship it.\n\nThe doc file is understandably minimal so just nuke it.\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2023-01-18T15:03:08.000+00:00",
      "committer_name": "João Valverde",
      "committer_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "committed_date": "2023-01-19T00:17:56.000+00:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/9e6faf416909379423620c52b7bd72e2f3b1895d"
    },
    {
      "id": "277605ac57ad92f2603ffb6a1a8c7639d6a98441",
      "short_id": "277605ac",
      "created_at": "2023-01-19T00:17:56.000+00:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "24ab9c0aaad4c1c022f735c04322898cb9be693d"
      ],
      "title": "Windows: Do not ship dftest in installers",
      "message": "Windows: Do not ship dftest in installers\n\nDFTest is a developer-oriented utility and none of the other\nplatforms ship it to end-users.\n\nRemove it from the windows installers.\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2023-01-18T15:42:44.000+00:00",
